OL,3,GNEWSASchool looks set for drama and
OL,4,Asport facility boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey school is poised to receive
OL,7,Fpermission to build an extension for
OL,8,Fnew drama and sports facilities on its
OL,9,Fcampus.
OL,11,FPlanning officers are recommending
OL,12,Fcouncillors approve the revamp of St
OL,13,FPeter's Catholic School in Guildford
OL,14,Flater this week.
OL,16,FThe scheme would see the school's St
OL,17,FCecilia's building get a two-storey
OL,18,Fextension for new PE facilities, plus
OL,19,Fchanging rooms, a drama studio and a
OL,20,Fhospitality suite.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
